      "camp_750_core_point": "Team A physically holds four Kings (+40), four Tens (+40), four Fives (+20), and the Dragon (+25) = +125 physical points. Capping Team A at 100 requires inventing an unwritten rule that confiscates and destroys 25 points of legitimately captured cards."
    },
    "argument_6_digital_and_tournament_precedent": {
      "status": "BrettspielWelt (BSW) was developed directly in cooperation with Urs Hostettler and Fata Morgana. All licensed engines (BSW, BGA, Yucata) and official tournament directors record +125 and -25."
    }
  },
  "current_conviction": "750 is indisputably correct. Mathematical, physical, textual, and official implementation evidence all align on 750."
}

